  ANT-2026-0JXJVEVY

  Custom events maintains a cache of user events, it is possible to have
  a corrupt stream that has a valid message with one message type (which
  can be custom/unit/span/int) and then has the same event with a
  different message type.

  This would never be encountered in a real program but can lead to a
  crash.


